<title>POLAND: EFEKT MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>EFEKT MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.10 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.16 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.12 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Sales		    2.55 vs   1.27</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.26 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.43 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.31 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Sales		    7.02 vs   3.18</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler and retailer is</p>
<p>Korporacja Gospodarcza Efekt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
